Package: fastrap
Title: Fast Rangeland Analysis Platform Cover Extraction for Polygons
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Noah", "Weidig", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "weidignc@gmail.com")
Description: One function, extract_rap(), that returns per-feature mean
    vegetation cover from the Rangeland Analysis Platform (RAP) annual
    vegetation cover v3 (CONUS, 1986-2025, about 30 m). Only the windows of
    the cloud-optimized GeoTIFF that each feature touches are read over HTTP,
    in parallel, and cached on disk. Extraction uses exact, area-weighted
    coverage fractions via exactextractr and runs in spatially sorted chunks
    so memory stays flat for large layers.
